{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kamp Amersfoort"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:64608"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Nationaal Monument Kamp Amersfoort"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lara Elemans"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nationaal Monument Kamp Amersfoort"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Nationaal Monument Kamp Amersfoort, op de grens van Leusden en Amersfoort, is een van de drie bekendste Nederlandse herinneringscentra. In de periode 1941 tot 1945 hebben ongeveer 37.000  gevangenen voor korte of langere tijd vastgezeten in dit doorgangs-, tevens strafkamp dat onder direct bevel stond van de SS.<\/p><p>In de loop der jaren heeft Nationaal Monument Kamp Amersfoort meer dan 100 oud-gevangenen kunnen interviewen over hun tijd in het kamp tijdens de Tweede Wereldoorlog. Dit zijn bijzondere interviews, die een indrukwekkend inkijkje geven in hoe het leven indertijd was in Kamp Amersfoort. Verhalen over strafappèls, het slechte eten, het wrede regime, maar ook over medegevangenen en hoe je als gevangene probeerde te overleven. Voor zover mogelijk worden alle interviews in de komende tijd beschikbaar gesteld.<\/p><p>Het interviewteam:<br>Diete Oudesluijs, Eddy van der Pluim, Dick van den Berg en Karel Kreuning.<\/p><p>Team annotatie:<br>Ruud Slabbertje, Ruud Boelen, Jertske Pasman, Siebe de Vries, Leen Bakker, Willem Tjipjes, Aloysius Michielsen, Jan Ulehake, Bram Faber<\/p><p>Spraakherkenning:<br>Hetty van Oel, Henny Wind<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral History"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"PDA - Polizeiliches Durchgangslager Amersfoort"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Concentratiekamp"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Rozentuin"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bunker"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Schietbaan"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"EASY-collectie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Schutzstaffel - SS"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2016-01-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive"